[{"title":"春日萧氏静安堂同诸客赏兰赋长律一首","author":"刘崧","text":"根移澧浦植盆沙，好在兰陵隐士家。\n翠颖齐抽千万叶，玉芽初试两三花。\n丹房晓浥金茎露，紫晕春寒石洞霞。\n幽操能忘尼父叹，哀歌敢动楚人誇。\n林间解佩伤薋菉，江上停舟感揭车。\n幸过高堂春酒熟，与君烂醉答年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中道出芗城将访新安希颜王徵君不果有作奉寄","author":"刘崧","text":"五老山人白锦袍，十年不出卧江皋。\n春前早喜传佳句，座上何因倒浊醪。\n落魄由来知传癖，凭凌犹自想诗豪。\n杜陵抱病犹耽饮，庾信还乡且赋骚。\n欲叩柴门看野竹，直愁寒雨乱庭蒿。\n江通值夏波澜阔，山入芗城紫翠高。\n作客共怜双鬓改，怀人谩使寸心劳。\n凭谁寄语溪南树，准拟秋来系小舠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山寺","author":"刘崧","text":"清远县东三峡长，峡山好在峡山央。\n寺门临水叠崖石，殿角挂山欹栋梁。\n幽涧鸟啼如解语，阴崖花发不知霜。\n将军自昔开蛮洞，庶子何年去帝乡。\n门掩野祠烟寂寂，船通官驿水茫茫。\n偶便禅悦堪娱性，不信猿声解断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉题王氏勤有书堂十四韵","author":"刘崧","text":"朱雀桥边燕子飞，故家文物重京畿。\n华堂高敞青霄近，此老风流白发稀。\n门引秦淮春水绿，窗含勾曲晚烟微。\n席间上客千金剑，庭下佳儿五綵衣。\n坐拥词林分旖旎，行缘艺圃袭芳菲。\n书联缃帙文韬锦，轴散牙签字刻绯。\n阆苑花明千琬琰，海门月照万珠玑。\n芸房剔蠹风初定，草閤囊萤露未稀。\n一息故应存夜气，分阴还自惜春晖。\n琢磨拟并荆人璞，累积何惭乐妇机。\n舒卷长怀吾道在，研钻莫遣壮心违。\n极知力穑功相近，转觉嬉游事总非。\n学习可忘飞振振，趋程好在策騑騑。\n公侯必复非难事，贤圣由来此共归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长律十四韵送彭公权教授还永新","author":"刘崧","text":"六千里外燕山客，白发还乡遂苦心。\n杨柳堠边风一叶，胡桃园里雪千林。\n路经齐楚冰犹壮，春到湖山暖渐深。\n龙庙读碑山窈窈，神冈分棹水沉沉。\n行寻梅洞跻危石，笑指荷峰数近岑。\n弟妹入门惊老色，邻儿候马识乡音。\n新城桃李从头看，故冢松楸逐处寻。\n竹底扫云安坐榻，花间载酒濯尘襟。\n糁盐芋粽朝供饤，下豉莼羹早溉鬵。\n定解狐裘披白苧，更从鸡黍饭黄金。\n山游曳杖应行乐，乡饮当筵亦醉吟。\n此日衣冠还旧俗，他年图画记斯今。\n茶园江馆曾题句，松室山房昔挂琴。\n我亦十年离旧隐，烦君一一访登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汝南韦布","author":"刘崧","text":"汝南韦布不易得，闭户读书无所为。\n掉头不入将军府，开口解赋骚人词。\n常思隐去有鹿伴，只爱步行无马骑。\n石室烟青时炼药，山源水黑昼临池。\n才华自信古难匹，姓字不传人少知。\n闻说崆峒山石上，时时乘月自题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书怀廿四韵奉柬范实夫李子翀","author":"刘崧","text":"楚也飘零客江县，足茧重胼发垂面。\n妻孥隔越异忧戚，朋好过从足谈宴。\n清真豫章范文学，爽迈筠阳李司掾。\n跬步翻愁两地分，一日何嫌十回见。\n刻烛题诗促漏筹，操弦度曲回歌扇。\n暖酿浮膏露溢罂，寒藤洒墨云栖砚。\n有时斫地思拔剑，无复临边事传箭。\n征途潇洒送日月，裋褐凄凉杂霜霰。\n微辞往往想慰藉，弱质区区独贫贱。\n季子还从鬼谷游，贾生未遇吴公荐。\n坐怜人事袛落叶，行恐年华剧飞电。\n家寄龙州紫菊鲜，田荒珠浦青粮遍。\n异郡仍淹伯氏书，高堂未视家君膳。\n往岁深怜饥馑馀，此日何堪疫灾臶。\n历乱床帷夜雨萤，萧条梁屋秋风燕。\n何人鼎俎饫禄食，于我箪瓢寡吞咽。\n天地悠悠白日愁，山川历历浮云变。\n由来气槩重许与，胡乃暌离及攀饯。\n李也行听花县琴，范今归扫松冈奠。\n已嗟垂橐少倾倒，直恐穷年失才彦。\n云海惊心未得随，泥涂回首何由援。\n干将有神思一试，璞玉无瑕羞自衒。\n百年出处在远期，一作歌行写深眷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘氏遂初堂","author":"刘崧","text":"君家旧宅好林泉，乱定归来值万钱。\n燕子华堂犹故物，桃花流水自当年。\n共看帘捲清溪雨，尚想书藏古壁烟。\n毡复已闻群盗愧，笏存今见远孙贤。\n初心早向艰危遂，盛事应当久远传。\n忽忆善和三易主，柳家门地最堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"刘崧","text":"上马拂春衣，金鞭独自挥。\n蛾眉镜中好，但恨不能飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"刘崧","text":"传语通州估，南船甚日还。\n黄金知易得，留取铸红颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"刘崧","text":"夫婿泛淮船，闺门一步前。\n如何中夜梦，却在大江边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题胡思斋水禽墨戏四首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"春水荡菰蒲，双双出翠凫。\n那能远相逐，不解自相呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题胡思斋水禽墨戏四首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"谁与传符敕，游时水自开。\n江湖风浪恶，不见绣衣来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题胡思斋水禽墨戏四首 其三","author":"刘崧","text":"黄芦风袅袅，相逐下晴矶。\n却忆秋江上，衔书来去飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题胡思斋水禽墨戏四首 其四","author":"刘崧","text":"鼓吹传朱鹭，铙歌事已非。\n秋风荷叶底，憔悴白云衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭君祠","author":"刘崧","text":"承诏辞金阙，衔悲入塞城。\n可怜沙上月，浑似汉宫明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上北岩","author":"刘崧","text":"凉风四山合，月上西崖早。\n古道断归樵，啼螀在秋草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石磴","author":"刘崧","text":"岩洞何人道，仙凡此路分。\n不缘苔藓滑，石磴自流云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"憩白云庵","author":"刘崧","text":"解带白云中，来寻仙子宫。\n始知山顶上，容易得天风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坛树","author":"刘崧","text":"门前古坛树，树老半无枝。\n里有百岁翁，不知栽树时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮萍逐流水","author":"刘崧","text":"浮萍逐流水，水去萍著泥。\n尔自失所依，出处安得齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松下垂钓图","author":"刘崧","text":"城市何年别，烟霞尽日閒。\n松潭明月上，把钓不知还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹图","author":"刘崧","text":"曾过筼筜谷，青青万玉奇。\n官中采箭尽，留得小横枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹图","author":"刘崧","text":"寒色似潇湘，娟娟翠筱长。\n林间疏雨过，石上紫苔香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯木竹石图","author":"刘崧","text":"谁种山中玉，空闻天上槎。\n只今尘似海，便拟竹为家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月落","author":"刘崧","text":"月落山正昏，群乌乱鸣起。\n客子中夜行，相呼渡烟水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小松","author":"刘崧","text":"手拂青松树，新抽数寸条。\n殷勤将雨露，头上是云霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"刘崧","text":"昨日通州估，还家已十年。\n忽闻盐价好，又驾赣州船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白头并立图","author":"刘崧","text":"同宿复同飞，茸茸浅碧衣。\n白头秋树里，相倚看斜晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题春江垂钓图","author":"刘崧","text":"坐把钓鱼竿，虚潭翠如泻。\n轻舟浮不动，只在松阴下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹林观弈图","author":"刘崧","text":"野处竹为邻，衣冠似汉秦。\n战争浑未已，空老看棋人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"刘崧","text":"饥雀聚檐楹，庭虚冻色明。\n松下无人迹，时闻坠雪声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24514,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四皓对弈图","author":"刘崧","text":"危坐看枰棋，天寒白发稀。\n如何忘世者，独自角危机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"残雪","author":"刘崧","text":"山中残雪在，背日半稀微。\n却意长松下，閒云不解飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄弟子彦","author":"刘崧","text":"好在雩阳县，能忘五月归。\n峡中有船便，莫遣报书稀。","collect