,"author":"刘崧","text":"千步更万步，步入白云中。\n独归里良寺，还望紫瑶宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遁迹山中日有幽事因即涧沐云卧草栖木食为四题与子中兄子彦弟同赋以自释 其一 涧沐","author":"刘崧","text":"涧沐爱深冷，晨光净如练。\n日出发未晞，白云满吾面。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遁迹山中日有幽事因即涧沐云卧草栖木食为四题与子中兄子彦弟同赋以自释 其二 云卧","author":"刘崧","text":"閒依青石磴，云卧此林下。\n回风忽吹散，揽之不盈把。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遁迹山中日有幽事因即涧沐云卧草栖木食为四题与子中兄子彦弟同赋以自释 其三 草栖","author":"刘崧","text":"秋草深数尺，我栖在其间。\n英英鸿鹄志，乃与雉兔班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遁迹山中日有幽事因即涧沐云卧草栖木食为四题与子中兄子彦弟同赋以自释 其四 木食","author":"刘崧","text":"山木各抱实，我饥日方长。\n何曾劳种植，愧尔自甘香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离人","author":"刘崧","text":"离人如猕猴，争聚山谷里。\n木叶不充衣，秋风夜中起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离